  "notes": [
    {
      "at": [
        -30,
        -26
      ],
      "id": 16,
      "text": "ATmega328P from its factory fuses (8 MHz RC divided by 8) with avr328_serial: the firmware sets CLKPR to\nrun at 8 MHz, USART0 at 38400 baud. Run (F5) and open the terminal (USART): it greets; type to see the\necho, l toggles the LED on PB5, t prints the temperature sensor's code, ? prints how many bytes arrived.\nThe count lives in the EEPROM: save the project, and it survives stop, start and reopening."
    }
  ],
